  "release_date": "2026-07-01",
  "summary": "Sixth Ego Link P0 engineering key release. It freezes the bounded current-boot raw POST retry proof after LTE-008 fix1 and LTE-009: a controlled first raw LTE location_report POST failure is retained as raw evidence, no derived event is created from that failed attempt, the same raw frame is retried successfully, and the USB-Free request_location -> location_report -> location_observation -> ACK loop completes over SIM7670G LTE with retry counters visible.",
  "firmware_version": "0.1.0-lte009-raw-post-retry-fault",
